# Suggested .gitignore for Saturn/GAME_BASIC/
# Keeps copyrighted (C)1998 ASCII Corp./Bits Laboratory/ESP inc. material,
# and anything derived directly from it, out of the public repository.
# Paths are relative to this folder (GAME_BASIC/).

# --- The Saturn CD ---------------------------------------------------------
#GAME_BASIC_CD/*.iso
#GAME_BASIC_CD/GAME_BASIC_files.zip
GAME_BASIC_CD/extracted/
# Disassembly listing of the interpreter (made by tools/gbcd_disasm.py)
GAME_BASIC_CD/*.s
# Leftover from the credits translation, now in GAME_BASIC_CD/README.md
GAME_BASIC_CD/STAFF_EN.md

# --- The Windows 95 tools CD and the programs unpacked from it -------------
#WIN95_TOOLS_CD/*.exe
#BASTERM/Basterm.exe
#BASTERM/BASTERM.HLP
#BASTERM/basterm.cnt
#DXFCONV/*.EXE
# Ghidra decompilation of Basterm.exe
#BASTERM/Basterm_decompiled.c

# --- Python and macOS clutter ----------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# --- Optional: other original material from the CDs ------------------------
# These are also (C)1998 originals. They are small and useful to readers,
# but uncomment them to keep the repository free of original content.
# The DXFCONV tests skip themselves when SAMPLE/ is missing.
# BASTERM/BASTERM_help_text_JP.txt
# BASTERM/readme_JP.txt
# DXFCONV/README_JP.TXT
# DXFCONV/HEADBAS.B
# DXFCONV/SOURCE/
# DXFCONV/SAMPLE/
# GAME_BASIC_box_*.jpg
